    "group": "Might of the Moritoi",
    "summary": "Each **ADEPTUS CUSTODES DREADNOUGHT** unit of yours gets a bonus set by its strength:\n\n- +2 OC while it is at its **starting strength**.\n- While below its starting strength, its attacks may re-roll a **hit roll** of 1.\n- While **below half-strength**, its attacks may re-roll a hit roll of 1 and a **wound roll** of 1.",
